WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
A before-and-after is only useful when you show the decision.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Script: show a rough draft and its edited version. Pause on the change. Explain why the change improves clarity, then mention what meaning stayed the same. Use your own draft or licensed material; do not expose private client work.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Explain one edit decision in your next tutorial.
